{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>MCBackup Pro 是一款為 iPhone 與 iPad 而設的通訊錄備份與轉移工具，適合準備更換裝置、想整理電話簿，或擔心聯絡人意外遺失的用家。它支援 VCF（vCard）與 CSV 格式匯出，備份與還原全程在裝置本機完成，無需電腦、帳戶或伺服器配合。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>離線備份與整理通訊錄</h2>\n<p>開啟應用後，輕點一下即可把整份通訊錄備份到裝置，並可選擇以 VCF 或 CSV 格式匯出，方便日後還原或轉移到新手機。內建的重複聯絡人合併功能會自動清理多餘項目，用家亦可按職稱、生日分類管理，或只挑選指定聯絡人匯入、刪除與分享。備份檔案可經電郵傳送或存到雲端，全程離線操作。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-349-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-350-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-351-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-352-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-353-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-354-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：MCBackup Pro – Contacts Backup</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T08:39:57.080168+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":367,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}